# Reservas (`reservas/`)

- React + Vite · store Supabase `ops_kv` (`reservas`, `tpvReservaAlerts`)
- Clave: `reservas/server/reservas-store.js` · APIs `reservas/api/*`
- UI: `reservas/src/App.tsx`, `pages/StaffPage.tsx`
- **Anti-regresión:** no Edge Config / CrudCrud; deploy CLI preferente

# ERP (`erp/`)

Next.js 15 App Router · Supabase + RLS.

| Ruta | Uso |
|---|---|
| `/login` | PIN ERP |
| `/gestion` | Dashboard |
| `/gestion/caja` | Caja TPV / cierres |
| `/gestion/top-ventas` | Ranking productos (ops_kv jornada/cierres) |
| `/gestion/historial` | Movimientos |
| `/gestion/nuevo` | Alta gasto/ingreso |
| `/gestion/fiscal` | Trimestral |
| `/gestion/rrhh` | Personal / nóminas |
| `/gestion/proveedores` | Proveedores |
| `/gestion/documentos` | Storage docs |
| `/gestion/perfil` · `/gestion/mas` | Cuenta / más |

Lectura TPV: `erp/src/lib/ops-kv.ts`, `api/jornada`, `api/cierres` (Supabase directo).
